                  <path d="M9.5,3A6.5,6.5 0 0,1 16,9.5C16,11.11 15.41,12.59 14.43,13.73L14.7,14H15.5L20.5,19L19,20.5L14,15.5V14.7L13.73,14.43C12.59,15.41 11.11,16 9.5,16A6.5,6.5 0 0,1 3,9.5A6.5,6.5 0 0,1 9.5,3M9.5,5A4.5,4.5 0 0,0 5,9.5A4.5,4.5 0 0,0 9.5,14A4.5,4.5 0 0,0 14,9.5A4.5,4.5 0 0,0 9.5,5Z"/>
